# riscv64-linux with Zkt selected. Zkt changes codegen only by admitting the
# secret multiply, so this column serves the ct group and nothing else: every
# other case would repeat the riscv64-linux golden. the three patterns match
# every group but ct.

[!c]*    not a ct case; riscv64-linux carries it.
c[!t]*   not a ct case; riscv64-linux carries it.
ct[!/]*  not a ct case; riscv64-linux carries it.
